<item><title>Nigeria moves to buy 3.5 million fertiliser bags for dry-season farms</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/nigeria-moves-to-buy-3-5-million-fertiliser-bags-for-dry-bd2031/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/nigeria-moves-to-buy-3-5-million-fertiliser-bags-for-dry-bd2031/</guid><category>Nigeria</category><description>The government will procure from local producers and distribute the fertiliser to farmers at affordable prices under a presidentially approved initiative.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:35:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" length="32450" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
